# Dev-only scenario seeding for the Course Inquiry Dashboard.
# Available in Development, or when DevTools:ScenarioSeeding=true.
# The dashboard front-end drives the same endpoints via fetch (same origin).

@host = http://localhost:5083

### List the available scenarios (name, description, size)
GET {{host}}/api/dev/scenarios

### Simulate the full, realistic demo dataset (28 rows, resets first)
POST {{host}}/api/dev/scenarios/demo

### Simulate multi-page pagination (45 rows)
POST {{host}}/api/dev/scenarios/pagination

### Simulate the troubleshooting demo dataset (26 rows: worked backlog + hidden recent New + a duplicate email)
POST {{host}}/api/dev/scenarios/missing-inquiries

### Simulate a single page of mixed statuses (6 rows)
POST {{host}}/api/dev/scenarios/single-page

### Simulate a fresh, all-New triage inbox (12 rows)
POST {{host}}/api/dev/scenarios/all-new

### Simulate the empty state
POST {{host}}/api/dev/scenarios/empty

### Append the demo set WITHOUT clearing first
POST {{host}}/api/dev/scenarios/demo?reset=false

### Clear every inquiry
DELETE {{host}}/api/dev/scenarios


# ── Troubleshooting demonstration dev tools ─────────────────────────────────
# Available in Development, or when the matching DevTools:* flag is set.

### Read the intake fault switch (armed count + total injected)
GET {{host}}/api/dev/intake-fault

### Arm the next submission to fail before any write (0 disarms)
PUT {{host}}/api/dev/intake-fault
Content-Type: application/json

{ "armCount": 1 }

### Submit one inquiry through the real endpoint — expect 500 with a traceId, no row stored (fault armed)
POST {{host}}/api/inquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Fault", "lastName": "Demo", "email": "fault.demo@example.test", "courseName": "Intake fault demonstration" }

### Reconciliation summary (count-by-status, last-7-days, duplicate emails)
GET {{host}}/api/dev/reconciliation

### Reconciliation by reported email (stored-but-hidden vs never-stored tiebreaker)
GET {{host}}/api/dev/reconciliation/by-email?email=hannah.becker@example.com
